/*
  TripPlannerMap.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0178 · TripPlannerMap (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `TripPlannerMap` resolves (table "TripPlannerMap") lives here with its web value.
  These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at
  integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface
  prompt owns its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  Group 1 is the exact keys + values extracted from the web source
  (features/driving/components/TripPlannerMap.tsx, namespace "tripPlanner.map").
  Group 2 backs the charge-stop popup metric template the native callout reproduces.
  Group 3 backs the native-only chrome (map label, legend, freshness chip, loading /
  error / empty, callout dismiss) and the VoiceOver labels.
*/

/* --- Group 1: web source (tripPlanner.map.*) --- */
"tripPlanner.map.origin" = "Origin";
"tripPlanner.map.destination" = "Destination";
